  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IT quality assurance in the EU assistance projects for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;The proposed action would aim at providing the EU Delegation and Ukrainian stakeholders in the area of JHA, including IBM and PAR, and possibly, depending on the available budget, also outside the JHA sector, with professional advice and hands-on support for IT-related matters.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;The specific objectives of this assignment are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Provide ad hoc support and advice to stakeholders on all IT-related matters &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Professionalize stakeholder&#xBF;s IT management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;TASK 1: Provide on ad hoc basis advice to the EU Delegation on IT systems/components of the EU funded projects in Ukraine, including Assessments studies and vision documents, and possible related issues not covered by other projects.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 33, 33);&quot;&gt;TASK 2: Assist and train selected stakeholders in their management of IT-related matters and interaction with other stakeholders and on-going projects, provide ad-hoc policy and legal advice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
